  "content": "<div class=\"ssrcss-15twdc6-Stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\"><div class=\"ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"headline\"><div class=\"ssrcss-usmnse-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><header data-testid=\"headline\"><h1 class=\"ssrcss-bh9yn6-Heading e10rt3ze0\" id=\"main-heading\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"headline\"><span role=\"text\">People who want to live on this almost-empty estate aren't allowed to buy the homes</span><img alt=\"Four semi-detached modern homes at the end of a street. There are solar panels on the roof and wooden cladding on the top of the buildings. Each home is painted a different colour. They are grown, green, yellow and grey.\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\"/></h1></header></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"image\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div class=\"ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1\" data-testid=\"image\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-hc6arm-StyledFigure e34k3c22\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1szz9nu-Placeholder etlorgc0\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 976w\" type=\"image/webp\"/><img alt=\"Four semi-detached modern homes at the end of a street. There are solar panels on the roof and wooden cladding on the top of the buildings. Each home is painted a different colour. They are grown, green, yellow and grey.\" class=\"ssrcss-egie1y-Image edrdn950\" height=\"2160.1864801864804\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/3840/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/c3e5/live/6a091240-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 976w\" width=\"3840\"/></picture></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-3uli8u-StyledFigureCaption ehbdhz00\"><span class=\"visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-15twdc6-Stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">At least 37 families have asked about buying the properties as homes</p></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"byline\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div class=\"ssrcss-sevsa1-ContributorContainer ee66fvo3\" data-testid=\"single-byline\"><div class=\"ssrcss-dt4z-ContributorInfo ee66fvo0\"><span class=\"visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0\">By</span><span class=\"ssrcss-nsjd43-TextContributorName epw3ir01\">Danielle Herbert</span><div class=\"ssrcss-dqo7s5-ContributorDetails ee66fvo2\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1m5444d-Text ee66fvo4\">BBC Wales</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div data-testid=\"rich-text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\"><b class=\"ssrcss-1xjjfut-BoldText e5tfeyi3\">An almost empty new build estate has sparked anger because rules state that the houses can be only sold as holiday homes, with one would-be buyer saying her grandparents would be \"turning in their graves\".</b></p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Parc Delfryn, Brynteg, is two miles from the Anglesey coast and home to <a class=\"ssrcss-1e0jzsh-InlineLink e1kn3p7n0\" href=\"https://www.gov.wales/second-homes-what-does-data-tell-us-html\">the second highest rate of holiday home users<span class=\"visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0\">, <!-- -->external</span></a> in Wales for its population size, yet <a class=\"ssrcss-1e0jzsh-InlineLink e1kn3p7n0\" href=\"/news/articles/c4gyqllgl1do\">14 of the 16 houses have not been sold</a> since 2023.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">But planning restrictions imposed before construction began mean they cannot be sold to people who want to live there and a challenge to the rules failed.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Anglesey council said changing rules would \"set a dangerous precedent\" for holiday homes approved around the island.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"What I can't get my head around is that the council think this is right for the area,\" said Jane Roberts, who grew up in Brynteg.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"They do not realise the impact it's having on local people.\"</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">She had plans to move back to the area, where her family have lived for generations, in 2024.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">But realised if she wanted to buy one of these homes, she would have to rent out her home in Llangefni to do so.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Since April 2024, second home owners on Anglesey pay an extra 100% council tax on their properties - unless the property is let out for at least 182 days a year.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">This followed a Wales-wide plan to allow councils to charge up to <a class=\"ssrcss-1e0jzsh-InlineLink e1kn3p7n0\" href=\"/news/uk-wales-politics-60575264\">four times their current level of council tax</a> as part of efforts to make it easier for people to afford homes where they grew up.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">In June 2023, the BBC reported Anglesey had seen the biggest jump in holiday home users in England and Wales over the past 10 years.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">As of late 2023, some 10% of the island's housing stock was classed as either second or holiday homes, according to planning documents - higher than in other areas of Wales and in the UK.</p><img alt=\"Jane Roberts has blonde shoulder length hair. She is photographed outside in a garden. She is smiling and looking at the camera.\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/540b/live/9cd20470-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"image\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div class=\"ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1\" data-testid=\"image\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-hc6arm-StyledFigure e34k3c22\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-17edh64-Placeholder etlorgc0\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/540b/live/9cd20470-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/540b/live/9cd20470-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/540b/live/9cd20470-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 480w\" type=\"image/webp\"/><img alt=\"Jane Roberts has blonde shoulder length hair. She is photographed outside in a garden. She is smiling and looking at the camera.\" class=\"ssrcss-egie1y-Image edrdn950\" height=\"549\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/549/cpsprodpb/540b/live/9cd20470-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/540b/live/9cd20470-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/540b/live/9cd20470-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/540b/live/9cd20470-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 480w\" width=\"549\"/></picture></span><span class=\"ssrcss-tzgxt7-StyledFigureCopyright e34k3c20\" role=\"text\"><span class=\"visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0\">Image source, </span>Jane Roberts</span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-3uli8u-StyledFigureCaption ehbdhz00\"><span class=\"visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-15twdc6-Stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Jane Roberts has fond memories of growing up in Brynteg, where her father and grandparents were born</p></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div data-testid=\"rich-text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"I didn't feel right about it,\" she said. </p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"My father and grandparents would turn in their graves if they saw these houses could not be sold to local buyers. </p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"It has put me off looking at other properties in the village.\"</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">One estate agent said there had been no viewings on the estate for 18 months.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Roberts, 66, said Brynteg, where her father and grandparents were born, \"was a lovely village to grow up in\".</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"We had the best childhood growing up there.\"</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">She said her daughter, who lives in Brynteg with her children, was \"not happy about this situation at all\", like \"a lot of people\" living there.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"It's not a good look for the area. It doesn't create a good feeling,\" she added.</p><img alt=\"A man with grey hair, stood outside in a car park. He is looking directly at the camera. He is wearing a dark grey knitted quarter zip jumper, with a high neck.\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"image\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div class=\"ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1\" data-testid=\"image\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-hc6arm-StyledFigure e34k3c22\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-uj0w5k-Placeholder etlorgc0\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 976w\" type=\"image/webp\"/><img alt=\"A man with grey hair, stood outside in a car park. He is looking directly at the camera. He is wearing a dark grey knitted quarter zip jumper, with a high neck.\" class=\"ssrcss-egie1y-Image edrdn950\" height=\"2160.446373217607\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/3840/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/dd6f/live/af9f6700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 976w\" width=\"3840\"/></picture></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-3uli8u-StyledFigureCaption ehbdhz00\"><span class=\"visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-15twdc6-Stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Phil Morrill says the homes are \"no use to anyone just lying empty\"</p></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div data-testid=\"rich-text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Roberts is not the only person from Brynteg who has struggled to understand the council's decision.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"There's too much red tape... it's terrible, it really is,\" said Phil Morrill.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"There should be nothing to stop anyone from buying and living in these... it doesn't make any sense at all. They're no use to anyone just lying empty like that.\"</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"It doesn't make any sense that local people shouldn't be able to buy and live in these houses,\" said Richard Jones.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"It's a good spot, right near a village pub, they would be ideal as family homes.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"It would be even better if the council bought them as social housing and rented them out, seeing as they're empty.\"</p><img alt=\"Richard Jones is stood in front of a large grassy field. He has short grey hair and is smiling and looking at the camera.\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"image\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div class=\"ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1\" data-testid=\"image\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-hc6arm-StyledFigure e34k3c22\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-g5m1wx-Placeholder etlorgc0\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 976w\" type=\"image/webp\"/><img alt=\"Richard Jones is stood in front of a large grassy field. He has short grey hair and is smiling and looking at the camera. \" class=\"ssrcss-egie1y-Image edrdn950\" height=\"1439.440167949615\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/2560/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/838f/live/bf36f2f0-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 976w\" width=\"2560\"/></picture></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-3uli8u-StyledFigureCaption ehbdhz00\"><span class=\"visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-15twdc6-Stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Richard Jones said \"it doesn't make any sense\" that locals are unable to buy the empty properties</p></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div data-testid=\"rich-text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Mike Williams of Beresford Adams is one of two estate agents trying to sell the holiday homes, and said leaving \"perfectly good properties\" empty was a \"complete and utter waste of money\".</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Williams, who lives in Brynteg, said he was \"frustrated\" that homes \"perfect\" for local people have been \"left lying dormant\".</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"We've literally had no viewings on the development for about a year-and-a-half,\" he added.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"The second home market was never really interested in places like Brynteg, they were more interested in places like Benllech and Moelfre, which are closer to the coast.\"</p><img alt=\"Mike Williams is photographed standing in front of a map of Anglesey. He has short grey hair and is wearing a black shirt.\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"image\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div class=\"ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1\" data-testid=\"image\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-hc6arm-StyledFigure e34k3c22\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-1pflr6j-Placeholder etlorgc0\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 976w\" type=\"image/webp\"/><img alt=\"Mike Williams is photographed standing in front of a map of Anglesey. He has short grey hair and is wearing a black shirt. \" class=\"ssrcss-egie1y-Image edrdn950\" height=\"2160\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/3840/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/b771/live/cf0e4700-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 976w\" width=\"3840\"/></picture></span><span class=\"ssrcss-tzgxt7-StyledFigureCopyright e34k3c20\" role=\"text\"><span class=\"visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0\">Image source, </span>Beresford Adams</span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-3uli8u-StyledFigureCaption ehbdhz00\"><span class=\"visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-15twdc6-Stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Estate agent Mike Williams says homes \"perfect\" for local people have been \"left lying dormant\"</p></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div data-testid=\"rich-text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">In <a class=\"ssrcss-1e0jzsh-InlineLink e1kn3p7n0\" href=\"https://dogfennaucynllunio.ynysmon.llyw.cymru/PublicAccess_Live/Document/ViewDocument?id=D493595C23BE47B3BEC720B261E14235\">a planning report<span class=\"visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0\">, <!-- -->external</span></a>, PLanD development consultants said at least 37 families, the majority local to Anglesey, had asked about buying the properties as homes in the \"tight-knit community\".</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Williams said people living in Brynteg and nearby knew the homes were empty and cannot be sold for residential use, leading to no further inquiries about them.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">PLanD planning consultant Simon James said the council tax changes for second homes in Wales had \"killed the holiday home market\".</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">\"These houses are built, they're sat there, and they are being left idle,\" he added.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">He believes a change of use for the properties would be \"beneficial\" and help meet housing needs in the area.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">PLanD confirmed it would appeal against the decision by the council to refuse the change of use to residential properties.</p><img alt=\"two semi-detached modern homes with solar panels on the roof. There is wooden cladding on the top of the buildings. A blue for sale sign can be seen outside the front of the properties.\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-l7emlr-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"image\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div class=\"ssrcss-1uy5kw5-FullWidthWrapper ep2nwvo1\" data-testid=\"image\"><figure class=\"ssrcss-hc6arm-StyledFigure e34k3c22\"><div class=\"ssrcss-ab5fd8-StyledFigureContainer e34k3c21\"><span class=\"ssrcss-wsur4k-Placeholder etlorgc0\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg.webp 976w\" type=\"image/webp\"/><img alt=\"two semi-detached modern homes with solar panels on the roof. There is wooden cladding on the top of the buildings. A blue for sale sign can be seen outside the front of the properties.\" class=\"ssrcss-egie1y-Image edrdn950\" height=\"1439.8482453367058\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/2560/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/240/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/320/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/480/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/624/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/800/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/standard/976/cpsprodpb/2310/live/ef567000-9def-11f1-898b-91bf436c749f.jpg 976w\" width=\"2560\"/></picture></span></div><figcaption class=\"ssrcss-3uli8u-StyledFigureCaption ehbdhz00\"><span class=\"visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0\">Image caption, </span><div class=\"ssrcss-15twdc6-Stack e1y4nx260\" spacing=\"6\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">Out of the 16 properties, only two have been bought since construction was finished almost three years ago</p></div></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-126h8e-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div data-testid=\"rich-text\"><div class=\"ssrcss-nqezkk-RichTextContainer e5tfeyi1\"><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">In a statement, the council acknowledged comments made by local residents, but said to support the application to make the homes available to buy on the open market, the applicant \"needed to provide evidence that the approved holiday accommodation scheme was no longer financially viable\".</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">It said a \"detailed\" viability assessment and supporting information had been requested \"on a number of occasions\" but was not provided - without which it could not support the application.</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\">It added: \"Approving the proposal without the necessary supporting information would have gone against the planning policy framework and could have set a precedent for similar applications elsewhere on the island.\"</p><p class=\"ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10\"><i class=\"ssrcss-xbdn93-ItalicText e5tfeyi2\">Additional reporting by Gareth Williams</i></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"topicList\"><div class=\"ssrcss-tcr9z1-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><div data-testid=\"topic-list\"><div class=\"ssrcss-nj9heb-StyledTagContainer ed0g1kj1\"><div class=\"ssrcss-17ehax8-Cluster e1ihwmse1\"><ul class=\"ssrcss-w8zanw-ClusterItems e1ihwmse0\" role=\"list\" spacing=\"2\"><li><a class=\"ssrcss-1ypd9i8-StyledLink ed0g1kj0\" href=\"/news/wales\">Wales</a></li><li><a class=\"ssrcss-1ypd9i8-StyledLink ed0g1kj0\" href=\"/news/topics/c51z9jlye57t\">Brynteg</a></li><li><a class=\"ssrcss-1ypd9i8-StyledLink ed0g1kj0\" href=\"/news/topics/c7rw214695pt\">Planning permission</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ssrcss-vxwoax-ComponentWrapper e1aon0op1\" data-block=\"promoList\"><div class=\"ssrcss-tcr9z1-Spacer e1aon0op0\"><h2 class=\"ssrcss-89o2pv-Heading e10rt3ze0\" type=\"normal\">More top stories</h2><ul class=\"ssrcss-1ughxsy-List e880cno1\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></div></div></div>",
